       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RMODE.
      * ROUNDED MODE (COBOL 2014) in COMPUTE, ADD and DIVIDE, and the
      * OPTIONS paragraph's DEFAULT ROUNDED MODE.
       OPTIONS.
           DEFAULT ROUNDED MODE IS NEAREST-EVEN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  R           PIC S9V9.
       01  V           PIC S9V999.
       01  I           PIC 9.
       01  VALS.
           05  FILLER  PIC S9V999 VALUE +2.250.
           05  FILLER  PIC S9V999 VALUE -2.250.
           05  FILLER  PIC S9V999 VALUE +2.350.
           05  FILLER  PIC S9V999 VALUE -2.350.
           05  FILLER  PIC S9V999 VALUE +2.251.
           05  FILLER  PIC S9V999 VALUE -2.249.
       01  VAL-TBL REDEFINES VALS.
           05  VAL     PIC S9V999 OCCURS 6.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 6
               MOVE VAL (I) TO V
               DISPLAY V " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE R ROUNDED = V
               DISPLAY R " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE R ROUNDED MODE AWAY-FROM-ZERO = V
               DISPLAY R " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE R ROUNDED MODE NEAREST-AWAY-FROM-ZERO = V
               DISPLAY R " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE R ROUNDED MODE NEAREST-EVEN = V
               DISPLAY R " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE R ROUNDED MODE NEAREST-TOWARD-ZERO = V
               DISPLAY R " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE R ROUNDED MODE TOWARD-GREATER = V
               DISPLAY R " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE R ROUNDED MODE TOWARD-LESSER = V
               DISPLAY R " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE R ROUNDED MODE TRUNCATION = V
               DISPLAY R
           END-PERFORM
           MOVE 0 TO R
           ADD 1.25 TO R ROUNDED MODE AWAY-FROM-ZERO
           DISPLAY R
           DIVIDE 3 INTO 1 GIVING R ROUNDED MODE TOWARD-GREATER
           DISPLAY R
           DIVIDE 3 INTO -1 GIVING R ROUNDED MODE TOWARD-LESSER
           DISPLAY R
           STOP RUN.
